flowchart TD
    Start([Client Request]) --> SchemaCheck{Valid JSON Schema?}
    SchemaCheck -->|No| Err400[Return 400 Bad Request]
    SchemaCheck -->|Yes| AuthCheck{JWT & Tenant Valid?}
    AuthCheck -->|No| Err403[Return 403 Forbidden]
    AuthCheck -->|Yes| FetchMemory[Fetch History State from memory-manager]
    FetchMemory --> CalcTokens[Calculate Payload & Context Tokens]
    CalcTokens --> WindowCheck{Tokens <= Model Window?}
    WindowCheck -->|No| Truncate[Request Truncation from token-budget-optimizer]
    Truncate --> ScoreModels
    WindowCheck -->|Yes| ScoreModels[Compute Model Scoring Matrix]
    ScoreModels --> CheckHealth{Primary Target Healthy?}
    CheckHealth -->|No| Failover[Select Secondary Target from Fallback Chain]
    Failover --> BuildPlan
    CheckHealth -->|Yes| BuildPlan[Construct Execution Plan]
    BuildPlan --> Dispatch[Dispatch Plan to context-assembler]
    Dispatch --> LogAudit[Emit Audit Telemetry Event]
    LogAudit --> End([Return 200 OK Response])